1. Features

Saves Time:
Customers book directly from your website without any back-and-forth. Logged-in users get their details filled in automatically, making bookings quick and effortless.

Easy Scheduling:
Shifts, time slots, and holidays are configured once and the system handles the rest — customers only see dates and times that are actually available.

Recurring Services:
Offer daily, weekly, or monthly cleaning plans so customers can set up a regular schedule without having to book every single time.

Conflict-Free Assignment:
Check staff and team availability before assigning anyone to a job, so you never end up with scheduling conflicts or double bookings.

Automatic Notifications:
Managers receive an instant email with full booking details the moment they are assigned, keeping communication smooth without any manual effort.

Clear Booking Tracking:
Every booking moves through a clear set of stages so your team always knows the current status of each request without having to ask around.

Role-Based Access:
Managers see only their own assigned bookings while administrators have full access, keeping data organized and secure at every level.

Complete Configuration:
Set up your service types, cleaning shifts, time slots, and holidays all in one place so your operations always reflect real-world availability.

Invoice Generation:
Once a booking is approved, an invoice can be created in one click with the customer details and service amount already filled in, saving your team from any manual billing work.

Live Business Dashboard:
A real-time dashboard shows your total bookings, revenue, approval rates, top services, and best performing teams all in one screen so you always have a clear picture of your business.

Flexible Pricing:
Each service type supports either a fixed price or an area-based rate per square foot, so the estimated amount is always calculated correctly based on the actual job size.


